# Title: Buffer Overflow Attempts
# ID: 18b042f0-2ecd-4b6e-9f8d-aa7a7e7de781
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Florian Roth (Nextron Systems)
# Date: 2017-03-01
# Tags: attack.t1068, attack.privilege-escalation
# Description: Detects buffer overflow attempts in Unix system log files
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* sourcetype="syslog" ("attempt to execute code on stack by" OR "0bin0sh1" OR "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA" OR "stack smashing detected")
